WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.984
Learn to tell the position and motion of objects in space using the cardinal points

00:00:04.984 --> 00:00:06.579
north, south, east and west

00:00:07.450 --> 00:00:12.760
A pupil walks 24 blocks east. Which compass direction is the pupil moving? The answer

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:17.007
is east. Use a compass rose labelled N, S, E and W.

00:00:17.867 --> 00:00:22.396
A learner walks toward north to school. To return on the same path, which direction

00:00:22.396 --> 00:00:25.717
must she walk? Pause and solve it in your exercise book.

00:00:26.533 --> 00:00:29.371
The answer is south. south is opposite north.
